r the holiday season.\n\nAs you step into Santa's boots, you'll embark on a joyful sleigh ride across the starlit skies. \n\nWith its cheerful graphics, enchanting soundtrack, and easy-to-learn gameplay, our VR Santa sleigh ride is the perfect game for young players and families looking to add a dash of festive fun to their gaming experience. So put on your VR headset and join Santa on this unforgettable holiday adventure!\"", "short_description": "Join Santa on a magical sleigh ride in our delightful VR game! Perfect for young players, this happy roller coaster adventure lets you help Santa deliver presents. Grab your controllers and soar through a festive world, spreading joy and holiday cheer!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wingsgames.com/#policy-christmasride", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wings Games", "support_website_url": "https://wingsgames.com/", "website_url": "https://www.wingsgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25910627911903661"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031462_388529116884222_1191132712077715549_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0mCuRlZFZ8QQ7kNvwHt2bWy&_nc_oc=AdkF04CiShAB0KRsxnbyaWnlLHyZRSdkv9dq7BeGgkqLiT